  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 2 December 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nThere's plenty to love about this beautifully designed home, from its generous proportions and stylish interiors to its superb location, with everything that makes the Eastern Bays so desirable close at hand.\r\n\r\nDeveloped by Gosling, with architecture by Paterson Cullen Archaus, this contemporary home has been thoughtfully crafted with quality, comfort and everyday living in mind.\r\n\r\nLight-filled and generously proportioned, the home offers two spacious bedrooms, two bathrooms and contemporary interiors with a relaxed, modern feel. The master bedroom features a generous wardrobe and private ensuite, while the second bedroom and bathroom provide excellent accommodation for family or guests. Thermally broken double glazing with acoustic glass enhances comfort and helps reduce outside noise, while two heat pumps provide year-round climate control. The home is also wired for home networking, adding to its everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a stylish, well-appointed kitchen featuring Fisher & Paykel appliances, an induction cooktop, sleek benchtops and ample storage. Open-plan living and dining spaces flow seamlessly to a generous outdoor courtyard, creating an inviting space for morning coffee, relaxed evenings or entertaining friends.\r\n\r\nLocation is a real highlight. With Eastridge Shopping Centre, The Eatery, cafés and restaurants just a short stroll away, everyday convenience is right on your doorstep. Kepa Bush Reserve is nearby for peaceful walks, while the beaches of Mission Bay, Kohimarama and St Heliers are all within easy reach. Excellent public transport connections and proximity to the CBD add to the appeal.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to simplify your lifestyle or enjoy a low-maintenance home in a sought-after neighbourhood, this is an opportunity to enjoy easy living without compromising on space, comfort or location.\r\n\r\nA little luxury, a fantastic location and a lifestyle to match.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
